{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20834","headline":"大堤曲 · 李贺","name":"大堤曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾家住横塘，红纱满桂香。\n青云教绾头上髻，明月与作耳边璫。\n莲风起，江畔春。\n大堤上，留北人。\n郎食鲤鱼尾，妾食猩猩唇。\n莫指襄阳道，绿浦归帆少。\n今日菖蒲花，明朝枫树老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20834.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20834","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}